                    <path d="M12 2C16.8706 2 21 6.03298 21 10.9258C21 15.8965 16.8033 19.3847 12.927 21.7567C12.6445 21.9162 12.325 22 12 22C11.675 22 11.3555 21.9162 11.073 21.7567C7.2039 19.3616 3 15.9137 3 10.9258C3 6.03298 7.12944 2 12 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path>
                  </svg></div>
                <div class="contact-office-info">
